{"id":"honne_tement","lemma":"honnêtement","pos":"adv","rank":1576,"glosses":["honestly (in an honest way)"],"ipa":"/ɔ.nɛt.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ac/Fr-honn%C3%AAtement.ogg/Fr-honn%C3%AAtement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Le croyez-vous honnêtement ?","en":"Do you honestly believe that?","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to believe","l":"croire"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Le crois-tu honnêtement ?","en":"Do you honestly believe that?","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to believe","l":"croire"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Vous devez répondre honnêtement.","en":"You must answer honestly.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to reply, to answer"},null]},{"text":"Je n'en ai honnêtement aucune idée.","en":"I honestly have no idea.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},{"g":"idea"}]},{"text":"Honnêtement, j'ignore tout.","en":"I honestly don't know anything.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to ignore","l":"ignorer"},{"g":"all"}]}]}